      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不！我的资质不适合跑长距离是事实，\n但这是两码子事。我有其他的理由。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b91ed0c6f140a92709ec38637a77bd11f4d7639150d08ea14ab61d343cb6ed8c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
