    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77ed4d671ac8cce3c123614d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "总之，现在我希望你能让我以“高松宫纪念”\n为目标。抱歉喔，这么突然。可以吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7caa359dbee87d39c0525aa8bb623cefbdacfc3030e19295e850f526d03a1ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
