    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30378d6563bedee940e91f2a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我在考虑一件事。\n总而言之，我想在古马级\n拿出更胜经典级的表演！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d2436f96d55ba0d82ce14f0cb4a062ab30099e61c59f21ff903101eceb77006",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
