      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不晓得你看了没？有很多人把我挑战\n三冠路线的经过写成报导哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97fc3981b12c79fad31fd47acceb29cc638a95aaf57f51b627fc228453f13502",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
